# Hellcat, Undying Vigilante under Grafdigger's Cage: "When Hellcat dies, return her to the battlefield ... She loses all
# abilities and gains haste." Hellcat in the graveyard is a creature card, which the Cage keeps from entering (CR 101.2,
# 101.3), so she stays there, with no +1/+1 counter, and "she" - the permanent returned - does not exist to lose
# abilities or gain haste. (The card in the graveyard has no ability that functions there, so the dump can't show an
# effect wrongly given to it; this runs the card's guard for that case.) Bot2 kills the 2/2 Hellcat with Lightning Bolt.

